##grflangid 0x00
##plural 0
STR_GRF_NAME                                :Simplistic Industry Chains
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION                         :{}Simplistic Industry Chains shakes up the industry setup via adding some additional cargoes but keeping the logics as vanilla.{}{}See readme for more info.{}{}License: GPL v2
STR_GRF_URL                                 :https://github.com/GraionDilach/TODO

#Error strings

STR_ERR_NO_TOYLAND                          :{STRING} is not designed to work with toyland climate.

STR_PARAM_NAME_ENABLE_CONVERTED_TOYLAND     :Enable Toyland cargos and industries on standard climates
STR_PARAM_DESC_ENABLE_CONVERTED_TOYLAND     :Might not work well with all NewGRF vehicle sets.

